              denotes the category of codirected diagrams in
              %math#mathml_9be2acc07c21c75d1ddc30375178e05b499afa75_35.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
